--------------------------------------

* Linux root filesystem images
  A build with no archive in app/src/main/assets/rootfs downloads one only
  after the user picks it and opts in. A build with an archive there carries
  that image inside the APK. Either way the image is governed by the license
  terms of the distribution it comes from, not by the dracxterm GPL-3.0
